Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:58:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Swipe previews never start from a stale image: a native
 snapshot whose window title changed is not used, the visible workspace is
 re-snapshotted after a title change, and a live frame older than 2 s is
 recaptured at the first contact

